# 60.84: a dedicated low-latency private recovery lane. Soroush occasionally
# does not emit private NewMessage/Raw updates on this account, while the new
# PM is already visible at the top of GetDialogs. Poll only the newest dialog
# slice, inspect dialog.message directly (no per-user get_messages RPC), and do
